  "name": "Actuarial and Predictive Risk Models",
  "courseCode": "Q2",
  "description": "The statistical machinery behind credit and insurance risk — survival analysis, GLMs, PD/LGD/EAD and expected loss — and the model-risk discipline that governs it. This is where machine learning meets a regulator who will ask you to justify every parameter.",
  "url": "https://contexai.org/academy/courses/q2-actuarial-and-predictive-risk-models/",
