    "@type": "EducationalOrganization",
    "name": "ContexAi Academy",
    "sameAs": "https://contexai.org"
  },
  "educationalLevel": "Professional",
  "teaches": [
    "On successful completion, you will be able to compute expected credit loss from its probability, severity and exposure components.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why the three components must be modelled and validated separately.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to validate a PD model on both discrimination and calibration, and judge which failure matters for provisioning.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to explain why censored observations cannot be discarded or treated as non-events.",
    "On successful completion, you will be able to compute a survival curve from censored duration data."
  ],
